  "proof": "For positive increasing w(x)=x^n, pair x and1\u2212x in the first centered moment: integral_(1/2)^1 (x\u22121/2)[w(x)\u2212w(1\u2212x)]dx>0. Hence mean>1/2; positive density inside(0,1) gives mean<1. Direct integration independently gives(n+1)/(n+2).",
